  "id": "hostile-attribution-bias",
  "term": "hostile attribution bias",
  "definition": "Hostile attribution bias is a cognition-related tendency linked to aggression in which a person is biased toward interpreting situations or others’ actions as hostile. It is described as an aggression-related cognitive factor that may interact over time with angry rumination.",
